      1,FROZEN,2025-07-02 12:00:00,9999-12-31 23:59:59
      2,PENDING,2025-01-01 00:00:00,2025-07-02 10:30:00
      2,OPEN,2025-07-02 10:30:00,9999-12-31 23:59:59;
    default.RATING:
